  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "果穂、今大丈夫か？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003010010,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はいっ！　なんですか？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "009",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/100900301/1009003010010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "仕事の相談なんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "公開オーディション番組があるんだけど、\r\nそれに出てみないか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003010020,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "公開……オーディション……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900301/1009003010020"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003010030,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "それって、ライブみたいにお客さんが見に来たり、\r\nテレビみたいに放送するってことですか？",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900301/1009003010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そう\r\n『G.R.A.D.』っていうんだけど……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "予選と決勝、あとは敗者復活戦があって、\r\n出場したアイドルは優勝を目指す",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ちょっと『W.I.N.G.』と似ているよな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003010040,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はい！　でも、敗者復活戦は、\r\n『W.I.N.G.』にはありませんでした！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/100900301/1009003010040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003010050,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "もし予選で負けちゃっても、\r\n決勝に出られるかもしれないってことですよね？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900301/1009003010050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだよ\r\n果穂は理解が早いな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003010060,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "えへへっ！",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900301/1009003010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "本番までに自己PRもするんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "方法は特に指定されてないから\r\n出るなら果穂にとって一番いいやり方を考えないとな",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003010070,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "あれ……？",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900301/1009003010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003010080,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "このオーディションって、\r\n放クラのみなさんと一緒じゃないんですか？",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900301/1009003010080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん、そうなんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "これは個人オーディションだよ\r\n果穂ひとりの力で頑張るんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003010090,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "ひとり……っ",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900301/1009003010090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003010100,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "ひとりで歌ったり踊ったりは、\r\nあんまりしたことないです！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900301/1009003010100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだなぁ……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ソロの仕事も増えているけど、\r\nユニットで動くことが多いもんな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だからこそ、このオーディションは\r\n果穂のためになるんじゃないかって思ってるんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003010110,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "あたしのためですか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/100900301/1009003010110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今、果穂はぐんぐん力をつけてきている\r\nユニットとしてだけじゃなく、個人としてもさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "どんな結果であれ、実力を試すチャンスだ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003010120,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "あたしの力を、試す……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900301/1009003010120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003010130,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "なんだかカッコいいです！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900301/1009003010130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "果穂はどうしたい？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003010140,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900301/1009003010140"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003010150,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん……あたし、出てみたいです！",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900301/1009003010150"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003010160,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "あたし、自分がどれくらいできるかって、\r\nあんまりわからなくて……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900301/1009003010160"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003010170,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "だから、『G.R.A.D.』に出て、\r\n知りたいです！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900301/1009003010170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか……！\r\nひとりなのは大丈夫か？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003010180,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "大丈夫です！\r\nひとりでもできます！　がんばりますっ！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900301/1009003010180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "了解だ\r\nありがとう、果穂",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "エントリーしておくよ\r\n一緒に頑張ろうな！",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003010190,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はいっ！　よろしくお願いします！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900301/1009003010190"
  },
  {
    "label": "end",
    "textFrame": "off"
  }
]